{"id": 996775, "slug": "firework-war", "name": "Firework War", "name_original": "Firework War", "description": "<p>During the Spring Festival, light up fireworks to drive away the Badluck Entities!</p><p>Firework War combines the traditional custom of lighting fireworks with the strategy of tower defense, delivering a fresh and exciting experience.</p><p>Classic fireworks like the Rainbow Fountain, Flash Shooter, Fire Wheel, Golden Basin, and Firecrackers take center stage in the game. Your task is to ignite these fireworks, unleash their dazzling effects, and fend off malevolent spirits to protect your home.</p><p>As you light up the sky, you'll also rack up plenty of joy value. Use it to buy more fireworks and keep the fun going! Immerse yourself in this unique taste of Chinese New Year tradition!</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-01-26", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-01-31T07:45:41", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/ad4/ad4441b18c2c64dcd3c509b0d4ae1f12.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/1b2/1b2cac039cbc25ad52c7c9501264a2d0.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 13, "added_by_status": {"owned": 12, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 6, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 175, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0, "additions_count": 0, "game_series_count": 0, "user_game": null, "reviews_count": 0, "community_rating": 0, "saturated_color": "0f0f0f", "dominant_color": "0f0f0f", "parent_platforms": [{"platform": {"id": 1, "name": "PC", "slug": "pc"}}], "platforms": [{"platform": {"id": 4, "name": "P